1
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:06,473
Welcome to Masar. This video shows nurses everything they need, step by step.

2
00:00:06,925 --> 00:00:11,485
Open the system link, write your name and your password, then tap Sign in.

3
00:00:12,542 --> 00:00:17,600
At the top there are three choices. Doctor request needs the doctor's approval.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:24,642
Clinic consumables needs no doctor approval and goes straight to procurement. Send to lab is for patient work.

5
00:00:25,093 --> 00:00:30,473
In a Doctor request, choose the clinic first, then the doctor, then the branch.

6
00:00:30,925 --> 00:00:36,974
Choose the type. Monthly is the normal order, from the 15th to the 20th of the month.

7
00:00:36,974 --> 00:00:39,465
Emergency is only for urgent needs.

8
00:00:39,917 --> 00:00:44,626
Write the item name and tap it, then set the quantity with plus and minus.

9
00:00:44,626 --> 00:00:48,507
Add every consumable you need, so they all come in one order.

10
00:00:51,085 --> 00:00:52,977
Cannot find an item in the list?

11
00:00:52,977 --> 00:00:58,180
Type its name in the search box, then choose to add it as a consumable or as a material.

12
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:03,915
It joins your request with a free-item tag, and procurement reviews it and completes its details.

13
00:01:03,915 --> 00:01:06,635
You can add up to five free items per request.

14
00:01:07,085 --> 00:01:12,665
When procurement links a free item to an existing one, you will find it next time by the name you know.

15
00:01:12,665 --> 00:01:16,674
Your name appears in purple, and the procurement name next to it in green.

16
00:01:16,674 --> 00:01:19,925
Pick it, and the request goes out with the procurement name.

17
00:01:20,376 --> 00:01:27,196
Check the summary, then tap Submit request. Your draft is saved by itself, so you never lose your work.

18
00:01:27,656 --> 00:01:34,464
Clinic consumables is for Sterilization, the Triage room and the derma device rooms, and now for every

19
00:01:34,464 --> 00:01:38,936
dental clinic too. Choose the place, add the items, and tap Submit.

20
00:01:39,386 --> 00:01:46,066
In My requests you can see the difference. The doctor request shows Doctor review, so it waits for the doctor.

21
00:01:46,066 --> 00:01:49,466
Clinic consumables shows New, so it reached procurement.

22
00:01:49,916 --> 00:01:57,116
Made a mistake in a quantity? Tap Edit items, change the number, or tap the bin to remove the item, then Save.

23
00:01:57,568 --> 00:02:02,836
Raised a request by mistake? Tap Cancel request, and write the reason if you like.

24
00:02:02,836 --> 00:02:09,068
You can edit or cancel while the request is in Doctor review or New. After that, ask procurement.

25
00:02:09,519 --> 00:02:16,409
Details shows every step and its time, the items and the comments. You can also write a comment as a reminder.

26
00:02:20,541 --> 00:02:26,851
When the driver delivers the box to your branch, you get an alert, and the card turns to Arrived at branch.

27
00:02:30,378 --> 00:02:37,388
Tap Receive and sign. Check every quantity and fix anything missing, then sign and tap Confirm receipt.

28
00:02:40,036 --> 00:02:45,905
If procurement cancels a request, the card shows Cancelled with the reason, and you get an email.

29
00:02:45,905 --> 00:02:48,386
Raise a new request if you still need it.

30
00:02:49,024 --> 00:02:53,280
For the lab, choose the doctor and write the patient's file number.

31
00:02:53,280 --> 00:03:00,204
For each work, choose the lab and the type, write your notes, and add a photo. The due date is set by itself.

32
00:03:04,952 --> 00:03:11,772
For an iTero scan, write the scan date, the iTero case number and the file number, then choose the lab.

33
00:03:19,272 --> 00:03:23,042
When the work comes back to your clinic, tap Confirm receipt.

34
00:03:27,222 --> 00:03:32,862
That's all. For any problem, use the Report button on the request. Thank you!
